 "description": "Get current prices, market caps and 24h changes for the top cryptocurrencies ranked by market cap. Use for 'top 5 coins', 'top crypto today', 'biggest cryptocurrencies', or a market snapshot. For one specific coin use getTickersById. Read-only; quotes sets the quote currencies (default USD), limit caps results. No API key required.",
